1/SAP97. May interact with GOPC (By similarity). Acts as an auxiliary subunit for AMPA-selective glutamate receptors (AMPARs). Found in a complex with GRIA1, GRIA2, GRIA3, GRIA4, CNIH2, CNIH3, CACNG3, CACNG4, CACNG5, CACNG7 and CACNG8 (By similarity). Interacts with GRIA1 and GRIA2 (PubMed:20805473). Interacts with MPP2 (By similarity)"}], "commentType": "SUBUNIT"}, {"commentType": "INTERACTION", "interactions": [{"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q9Y698", "intActId": "EBI-6659211"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q99767", "geneName": "APBA2", "intActId": "EBI-81711"}, "numberOfExperiments": 2, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q9Y698", "intActId": "EBI-6659211"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q12959", "geneName": "DLG1", "intActId": "EBI-357481"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q9Y698", "intActId": "EBI-6659211"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q15700", "geneName": "DLG2", "intActId": "EBI-80426"}, "numberOfExperiments": 2, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q9Y698", "intActId": "EBI-6659211"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q92796", "geneName": "DLG3", "intActId": "EBI-80440"}, "numberOfExperiments": 2, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q9Y698", "intActId": "EBI-6659211"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "P78352", "geneName": "DLG4", "intActId": "EBI-80389"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q9Y698", "intActId": "EBI-6659211"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q68DX3", "geneName": "FRMPD2", "intActId": "EBI-53993476"}, "numberOfExperiments": 2, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q9Y698", "intActId": "EBI-6659211"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q9HD26", "geneName": "GOPC", "intActId": "EBI-349832"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3